# Namuna Flow — theme deal index (50 themes)

Each theme is one file: paper, type, palette, and a way with photographs. A theme never says what a page contains or in what order. Two prompts in one theme make two pages.

Deal three themes that fit the prompt and clear the log. Pick the one whose material can carry the prompt (motion, photographs, code). Say which and why.

